## Why This Is Asked
This checks applying PCA in a constrained IoT setting where latency matters and devices have varied data. It emphasizes practical preprocessing, scope (global vs device-family), and turning loadings into actionable behaviors rather than theory.

## Key Concepts
- PCA component selection under latency and explained variance
- Imputation and scaling order for streaming data
- Interpreting loadings to drive device actions

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: fit-level PCA example
function fitPCA(X) {
  const Xclean = imputeMean(X);
  const Xscaled = scaleStandardize(Xclean);
  return PCA.fit(Xscaled, {nComponents: 4});
}
```

